  encounters:
  - introLines:
    - Hey there! I hear you are new here. I love seeing new businesses so I wanted
      to check this place out.
    - I am quite stuck behind a desk all day so I love seeing people be a bit more
      adventorous.
    - Honestly, I've been dreaming of starting my own thing, but the corporate paycheck
      is a heavy anchor to drop.
    optionA_Text: You should go for it!
    optionB_Text: It's definitely a lot of hard work.
    responseA_Lines:
    - I don't know. For now let me see how the pros do it. I'll be watching how you
      run this place for a bit and try some of your ice cream.
    responseB_Lines:
    - Yeah, you're right. For now let me see how the pros do it. I'll be watching
      how you run this place for a bit and try some of your ice cream.
